  "description": "A spacious and modern fully furnished one-bedroom garden-level apartment situated in the sought-after Grosvenor Square area of Rathmines.\n\nThe apartment benefits from its own private entrance, a separate office space and the availability of on-street parking by resident parking permit. \n\nThe location is excellent, with a wide range of shops, cafés, restaurants and local amenities within easy walking distance. The Ranelagh Luas stop is a short distance away, while there are also excellent bus services close by, providing convenient access to Dublin city centre and surrounding areas.\n\nFeatures include:\n* spacious living room area\n*Generous sized bedroom\n* Fully furnished\n* Separate office/ storage space\n* Own private entrance\n* Double glaze windows\n* Resident parking permit available for on-street parking\n* Modern interior\n* Sought-after Grosvenor Square location\n* Walking distance to Rathmines and Ranelagh amenities\n* Short distance to the Ranelagh Luas\n* Excellent selection of nearby bus routes\n* Excellent public transport connections",
